# ASC-HQ - Advanced Strategic Command

## Quick Start

**Build Instructions:** See [BUILD.md](BUILD.md) for complete build instructions.

**TL;DR - CMake (Modern):**
```bash
mkdir build && cd build
cmake ..
make -j$(nproc)
```

**TL;DR - Autotools (Legacy):**
```bash
./configure
make -j$(nproc)
```

